   103	
   104	- (3a) Confirm: comprehensive event management framework adopted (registration, custom attendance dashboard, QR-badge generation, automated post-event follow-up, event-ROI tracking). *Recommended default: yes.*
   105	- (3b) Confirm: event-cost approvals are required prior to event commitment. *Recommended default: yes.* (Approver assignments and routing decided in Order Management §3.04 as part of the merged-company approval framework.)
