Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:92:## Q2: LABOR QUOTE REQUEST INITIATION & DISTRIBUTION
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:94:**Question:** Who initiates labor quote requests and how are they sent to vendors?
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:96:**Answer:** Labor quote requests are initiated by either **Project Managers (PMs)** or **Account Managers (AMs)**, with requests sent to multiple vendors simultaneously when bidding is involved.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:99:1. **Initiation:** PM or AM sends out labor request
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:105:**Current System:** Email template form that PM/AM fills out and sends manually
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:107:**Desired Future State:** Move labor quote request email template into Orion system, allowing Orion to issue the email directly (reducing copy/paste and standardizing communication)
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:109:**[REQUIREMENT: Type: Functional]** - The system must support decentralized labor quote request initiation by multiple roles (PM, AM) with the ability to send requests to multiple vendors simultaneously.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:112:- As a PM, I need to send labor quote requests to multiple vendors so that I can compare bids and negotiate pricing.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:113:- As an AM, I need to quickly send labor quote requests without leaving the system so that I can reduce manual email steps.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:114:- As Operations, I need visibility into who is sending labor quote requests so that I can ensure quality control and consistency.
