Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:117:- [REQUIREMENT] Multiple users (PM, AM) can initiate labor quote requests without requiring approval/routing
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:118:- [REQUIREMENT] Labor quote request form should be available in Orion (not external email template)
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:119:- [REQUIREMENT] Users can select multiple vendors to receive same labor quote request
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:120:- [REQUIREMENT] System auto-generates and sends email to selected vendors with attachments/specifications
