Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:265:## Q6: LABOR QUOTE ACCEPTANCE & PO ISSUANCE
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:267:**Question:** How does KBMH accept labor quotes and what's the formal process?
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:269:**Answer:** Labor quote acceptance is INFORMAL. The formal acceptance is the issuance of a Purchase Order (PO).
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:272:- **Formal Acceptance:** Issuing a PO that references the vendor's quote number = acceptance
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:273:- **Communication:** Sometimes PMs/AMs send email communication to vendor confirming acceptance, but NOT required
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:274:- **PO Structure:** KBMH puts vendor's quote number on the PO line and issues PO against that quote number; this PO automatically becomes the acceptance
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:278:- Unaccepted quotes simply don't get a PO
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:279:- No official communication that a quote was rejected
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:281:**[REQUIREMENT: Type: Functional]** - System must support labor quote acceptance workflow where acceptance is tied to PO issuance and references vendor quote number.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:284:- As PM, I need to be able to mark a labor quote as accepted so that the system knows which quote to build the PO from.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:285:- As Finance, I need to see which labor quotes were accepted so that I can reconcile vendor costs against actual PO amounts.
