Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:289:- [REQUIREMENT] PO must link to and reference the original labor quote
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:290:- [REQUIREMENT] PO line must include vendor's quote number for traceability
