Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:313:**Answer:** YES - There can be multiple labor quotes per project scope, particularly when:
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:314:1. **Scope Changes During Project:** If scope changes after initial quote, new labor quotes may be requested
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:315:2. **Multiple Phases:** Multi-phase projects may have separate labor quotes per phase
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:316:3. **Hold-Back Strategy:** Sometimes KBMH requests quote for multiple trip charges but only issues PO for one trip charge and holds back others
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:319:- Scope: Project will need 4 trip charges
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:320:- Labor Quote Request: Quote for all 4 trip charges
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:321:- PO Strategy: Only issue PO for 1 trip charge initially
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:323:- If Additional Trips Needed: Come back to same accepted quote for additional trip POs
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:324:- Margin Benefit: Keep difference between quoted amount and issued PO as project margin if additional trips not needed
