Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:586:- Initial scope captured in: Marketing Request → Design Request (forms/documents)
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:588:- Process: Marketing Request > Design Request > Build out spec > Create proposal
