Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:601:- Reduce copy/paste of scope information across multiple systems/documents
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:603:**[REQUIREMENT: Type: Functional]** - Opportunity scope field(s) must be robust enough to capture detailed project scope and carry that through to related requests
