Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:633:## Q14: LABOR QUOTE TO PROPOSAL PROCESS
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:635:**Question:** How does a labor quote transition into a proposal/quote?
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:637:**Answer:** Process depends on how labor quote information is brought into the quote/order:
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:640:- Entire labor quote amount becomes one line on proposal
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:644:- Labor quote lines are broken out separately
