Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:651:3. Orion has "labor quote acceptance feature" with modal that allows selection:
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:652:   - User can choose WHICH lines to accept/bring over
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:655:5. Labor Quote remains linked to Quote for traceability
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:659:- Maintains traceability from labor quote → quote → sales order → invoice
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:660:- Can see full cost flow: quote → PO → invoice for reconciliation
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:662:**[REQUIREMENT: Type: Functional]** - System must provide labor quote acceptance feature that allows users to select which quote lines to move to proposal, with summary or itemized options.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:665:- As PM, I need to accept a labor quote and move lines to the proposal without manually re-typing costs.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:666:- As Finance, I need to see which proposal lines came from which labor quotes so that I can reconcile and catch discrepancies.
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:668:**BRD Requirements:**
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:669:- [REQUIREMENT] Labor quote acceptance modal/interface provided at quote level
Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Out_Questionnaire_PreQuote_Labor_Quotes_v1.0.md:670:- [REQUIREMENT] User can select subset of labor quote lines (for hold-back scenarios)
