Pre-Quote/KBMH/3 Output/Questionnaire_PreQuote_v1.0.md:43:- **REQ-007**: Support manual labor calculations with notes field for institutional knowledge (ADAPT) - "The team manually calculates rate in hours and adds the total to the cost column. So, okay, so they're not actually doing the calculations in here, they're doing it outside the system and then manually plugging them in here, which is fine." - Marcus Dallacqua
