   630	3\.06\.01 Your Business Requirements
   631	
   632	1. Explore customer approval workflows and tracking with automated D&B credit integration that may be available in ezyCollect\.
   633	2. Enable invoice schedules and template configuration for flexible billing arrangements and project\-based invoicing
   634	3. Support payment terms configuration and management with automated assignment based on customer credit profiles
   635	4. Provide unearned revenue management for prepayments with automated application at project completion
   636	5. Maintain financial audit trails and compliance reporting for all approval and payment processing activities
   637	
   638	3\.06\.02 Current State Process
   639	
   640	Pivot's customer approval process currently defaults new customers to 100% prepayment terms, with D&B credit checks performed by the accounting team and credit applications processed early in the sales cycle\. FluidPay handles credit card processing with fee pass\-through capabilities, but the system is described as "basic but functional" with limited integration to D365\.
   641	
   642	Prepayments are treated as unearned revenue and applied at project completion, requiring manual coordination between payment processing and project financial management\. Customer financial dimension setup requires manual coordination between sales, accounting, and operations teams to establish customer segmentation aligned with salesperson territories\.
   643	
   644	3\.06\.03 Orion/NetSuite Solution
   645	
   646	Orion/NetSuite provides comprehensive financial setup and management\. Invoice schedules and template configuration enable flexible project\-based billing arrangements while maintaining compliance with revenue recognition requirements\.
   647	
   648	Payment terms configuration and management capabilities automatically assign appropriate terms based on customer credit evaluation results while maintaining default 100% prepayment for new customers until credit approval\. The solution's unearned revenue management handles prepayment processing and automatic application at project completion without manual intervention\.
   649	
   650	Enhanced payment processing capabilities exceed current FluidPay functionality through multiple gateway options with superior fee pass\-through capabilities, automated payment link generation, and comprehensive integration with invoicing and revenue recognition processes\.
   651	
   652	3\.06\.04 Future State Process
   653	
   654	Customer approval workflows will initiate automatically upon new customer creation\.
   655	
   656	Invoice scheduling will operate through automated templates that handle project\-based billing arrangements, while unearned revenue management ensures accurate financial reporting through automated prepayment application processes\.
